          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/7/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "If it is attacked, CASCOON remains motionless however badly it may be hurt. It does so because if it were to move, its body would be weak upon evolution. This POKéMON will also not forget the pain it endured.",
